or:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Valentin Imperial Maya<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Zoetry Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u2026and more (inquire to see if your resort qualifies).<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Terms and Conditions:<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00a0Offer is valid on new Group Bookings with Wright Travel Agency, LLC and applies to the wedding couple ONLY. A minimum of 15 paid rooms with a minimum of 5 nights per room (or a total of 75 paid room nights) booked in the group block in order to qualify for the offer inclusions.\u00a0 Any complimentary nights or bookings made outside the group block will not apply towards this promotion.\u00a0 Airfare must be booked and paid to Wright Travel Agency, LLC or its supplier to receive a credit towards coach tickets.\u00a0 Wedding couple to receive credit 2-3 weeks after travel (valid for the wedding couple only when traveling from any US gateway, for a maximum value of $1,000.00 total for both tickets).\u00a0 Customer is responsible for any cancellation fees once airline tickets have been issued.\u00a0 Offer is subject to availability at time of signing contract and receipt of deposit, and may be changed or discontinued without notice.\u00a0 Blackout dates, minimum night stays, room category restrictions, seasonal surcharges, taxes, resort fees, and other restrictions may apply.\u00a0 Wright Travel Agency, LLC CST# 2084813-40.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.94.39.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"466e45c79ed6e12465a6cf616e9d0b4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"lornj29\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I struggled with figuring out how to do this as well. I ended up just putting a card in with our invites for their selections for our guests to return. This is what it looks like:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.vistaprint.com\/any\/lp.aspx?alt_doc_id=9165W-83A23-2J7&amp;amp;hash=7ffb4a&amp;amp;width=402\" alt=\"lp.aspx?alt_doc_id=9165W-83A23-2J7&amp;amp;hash=\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890069,"PostDate":1426793960,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279723\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279723-lornj29\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lornj29<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I struggled with figuring out how to do this as well. I ended up just putting a card in with our invites for their selections for our guests to return. This is what it looks like:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.vistaprint.com\/any\/lp.aspx?alt_doc_id=9165W-83A23-2J7&hash=7ffb4a&width=402\" alt=\"lp.aspx?alt_doc_id=9165W-83A23-2J7&hash=\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krpayne87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.94.39.142","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396538207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277461.jpg?_r=1427903725","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KRP87","Id":277461,"Name":"KRP87","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.137.185.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99efe70334ba6e7279b1953aceded38b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I gave everyone 2 options (per Juan Carlos)&amp;nbsp; but I have a couple of special diets in the group and he said those are handled differently.&amp;nbsp; So I have one celiac and one vegetarian - I told him the same meal could easily be for both so those two people will get whatever the resort wants to make that is gluten free and meat free.&amp;nbsp; If you ask your WC about it they can give you good guidance.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890177,"PostDate":1426871038,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I gave everyone 2 options (per Juan Carlos)\u00a0 but I have a couple of special diets in the group and he said those are handled differently.\u00a0 So I have one celiac and one vegetarian - I told him the same meal could easily be for both so those two people will get whatever the resort wants to make that is gluten free and meat free.\u00a0 If you ask your WC about it they can give you good guidance.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinbean@pgatourhq.com","IpAddress":"67.190.225.116","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363558492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267461.jpg?_r=1420723355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaxBchKay","Id":267461,"Name":"JaxBchKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.20.34.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e356c1672d84107942af93088e69504","RawContent":"Hi everyone,\n\nI&#039;m just curious what everyone plans to do after the reception. Is there an area to keep the party going for a bit longer?","Attachments":[],"Id":1890178,"PostDate":1426871062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone,<br>\nI'm just curious what everyone plans to do after the reception. Is there an area to keep the party going for a bit longer?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bredagostino@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.61.39.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393172676,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276832.jpg?_r=1416799718","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breanna2015","Id":276832,"Name":"Breanna2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.137.185.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"309c266a4fe6f2aef5180fbada1c84ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Breanna2015\"] - We are moving our party to the resort club at 10pm, come join us!!&amp;nbsp; Since we are wedding buddies, it would be fun.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll even have my party dress on by then LOL&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890193,"PostDate":1426876964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276832\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276832-breanna2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Breanna2015<\/span><\/a> - We are moving our party to the resort club at 10pm, come join us!!\u00a0 Since we are wedding buddies, it would be fun.\u00a0 I'll even have my party dress on by then LOL<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karinbean@pgatourhq.com","IpAddress":"67.190.225.116","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363558492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267461.jpg?_r=1420723355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JaxBchKay","Id":267461,"Name":"JaxBchKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.36.200","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"584c6ba00b6c99563c6cc2ca859d57d0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JaxBchKay\" post=\"1890193\" timestamp=\"1426876964\"]\n@[member=\"Breanna2015\"] - We are moving our party to the resort club at 10pm, come join us!!  Since we are wedding buddies, it would be fun.  I&#039;ll even have my party dress on by then LOL[\/quote]That sounds fun! Our reception ends at midnight so hopefully the party is still going in the bar by then time we get there!\n[quote name=\"Breanna2015\" post=\"1890230\" timestamp=\"1426894699\"]\nThat sounds fun! Our reception ends at midnight so hopefully the party is still going in the bar by then time we get there![\/quote]I&#039;ll still be wearing my wedding dress lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1890230,"PostDate":1426894743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JaxBchKay, on 20 March 2015 - 10:42 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276832\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276832-breanna2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Breanna2015<\/span><\/a> - We are moving our party to the resort club at 10pm, come join us!!\u00a0 Since we are wedding buddies, it would be fun.\u00a0 I'll even have my party dress on by then LOL<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat sounds fun! Our reception ends at midnight so hopefully the party is still going in the bar by then time we get there!<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Breanna2015, on 20 March 2015 - 03:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>That sounds fun! Our reception ends at midnight so hopefully the party is still going in the bar by then time we get there!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI'll still be wearing my wedding dress lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bredagostino@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.61.39.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393172676,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276832.jpg?_r=1416799718","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breanna2015","Id":276832,"Name":"Breanna2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"62152","Title":"Now Sapphire Weddings Formerly Paradisus Riviera","LastPostDate":1429974189},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":2490,"NextPage":2500,"PreviousPage":2480,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
