wright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ambassador for Azul Sensatori and Karisma resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Official Azul Sensatori thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensator<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recommended Travel agency: Wright Travel<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/'>http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/<\/a>","Email":"miriamkhan@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.150.115.214","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1274743063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"murmel","Id":228512,"Name":"murmel","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[],"Id":"72018","Title":"OFFICIAL Azul Sensatori Thread","LastPostDate":1429849450},{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":29,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":601,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1893268,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1429144178,"LastPoster":{"Id":2320