t;\/a&gt;- Planning threads from previous Azul Sensatori brides&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Post #22- Azul Laundry prices (updated January 2014)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Post #23- Mexican customs information&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Post #24-  Information regarding Le Chique restaurant&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Post #25- Reserved for future use&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Post #26- Reserved for future use&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;Again, if you have anything to add to this, please feel free to send me a PM and I will gladly update the thread.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;The old Azul Sensatori forum is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;** Please note, the information in this thread and on BDW has not been verified and is not guaranteed. The resort may change their wedding packages, pricing, details, etc. at any time without giving notice. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;This information is just to be used as a guideline and not as a contract of what the resort or BDW guarantees.&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt; When you are ready to book and sign a contract with the resort, you will need to rely on the information they have given you.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709014,"PostDate":1358789494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">Hello Ladies, <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">So figured I would try to arrange all the information in one area, so it was easy to find. If there is anything missing, or you want something added please PM me!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\">Here you will find the answer to almost all of your questions! If you don't see the answer, feel free to ask, but please look through the information first.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858591' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Basic Information (Resort Info, Contact Info, Legal Requirements)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858592' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3<\/a> - Wedding Packages<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858594' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Additional Wedding Options & Costs<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858595' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #5<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Wedding Locations<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858596' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #6<\/a>-<span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">\u00a0Reception Locations<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858597' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #7<\/a>- Dinner\u00a0Options & Cost<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858599' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #8<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- DJ Options, Music\u00a0and Costs<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858601' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #9<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Cake<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread#post_1858603' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #10<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Details (additional options, gazebo measurements, random questions and answers)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858604' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #11<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Flowers<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858605' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #12<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Spa<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858607' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #13<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Onsite Photographers<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858608' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #14<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Wedding Reviews<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858609' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #15<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Wedding Photos & Video Links<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858610' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #16<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Resort Reviews<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858611' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #17<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Bride Roll Call! Shoot me a PM with your user name, and wedding date and I'll add you to the list<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858612' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #18<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- Things I wish I would have known<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858613' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #19<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">- El Dorado laundry prices (updated May 2013)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/10#post_1858614' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #20<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">\u00a0Mexican customs information (dated May 2013)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/84306\/official-azul-sensatori-thread\/20#post_1858615' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #21<\/a>- Planning threads from previous Azul Sensatori brides<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Post #22- Azul Laundry prices (updated January 2014)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Post #23- Mexican customs information<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Post #24-\u00a0\u00a0Information regarding Le Chique restaurant<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Post #25- Reserved for future use<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Post #26- Reserved for future use<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\">Again, if you have anything to add to this, please feel free to send me a PM and I will gladly update the thread.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\">The old Azul Sensatori forum is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\">Thanks!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\">** Please note, the information in this thread and on BDW has not been verified and is not guaranteed. The resort may change their wedding packages, pricing, details, etc. at any time without giving notice. <strong><u>This information is just to be used as a guideline and not as a contract of what the resort or BDW guarantees.<\/u><\/strong> When you are ready to book and sign a contract with the resort, you will need to rely on the information they have given you.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married my best friend on January 24, 2011 at Azul Sensatori! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ambassador for Azul Sensatori and Karisma resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Official Azul Sensatori thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensator<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recommended Travel agency: Wright Travel<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/'>http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/<\/a>","Email":"miriamkhan@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.150.115.214","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1274743063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"murmel","Id":228512,"Name":"murmel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"908beeb346f212a8e55d296f3f887456","RawContent":"&lt;h1&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(100, 100, 101);\"&gt;Azul Hotels certified wedding coordinators &amp;nbsp;1- 866-527-4762 &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"182585\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/182585\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;There are three main types of Wedding Ceremonies that can be performed: Legal, Religious and Symbolic.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;CIVIL\/LEGAL CEREMONY&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;This ceremony type is available 7 days a week, at any hour you choose. If you want your marriage recognized as legal at home you must have civil ceremony, but you can combine this official portion of the ceremony with a religious ceremony if you choose. Although civil marriages performed in Mexico are legal in Mexico, you must legalize your marriage in your country of birth\/residence. Do this by registering your marriage certificate at your local City Hall when you return home.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/karismahotels.com\/ImEngaged\/Weddings\/Choose\/CeremonyTypesandRequirements\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Requirements&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Valid Passport:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Passports are required to enter Mexico and are also mandatory for a legal wedding to be performed. Passports must be presented to the On-Site Wedding Coordinator at the time of the wedding consultation.\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Tourist Card:&lt;\/strong&gt; These are provided on the plane prior to arrival into Cancun International Airport. Names on tourist card and passport MUST be the same.\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Advanced Hotel Stay:&lt;\/strong&gt; Bride and Groom must arrive at their hotel three business days prior to the legal wedding ceremony date in order to complete the blood tests and process the necessary documents. Saturday, Sunday and Mexican holidays are not considered working days.\n \n A Civil Ceremony Form filled out (available through your Wedding Coordinator) indicating witnesses name, age, nationality, home address and occupation.\n \n Additional documentation\n If the groom is divorced no additional documentation is needed.\n \n If the bride is divorced (at least a year must have passed before she can remarry) and her passport is under her maiden name no additional documentation is needed.\n \n If the bride is divorced and her passport is under her ex-husband&#039;s last name, then she must present her Birth Certificate and Divorce Certificate translated into Spanish by an Official Translator and should have an Apostille Seal. The Apostille Seal is necessary when issuing a document from one country to another for legal purposes. For information on how to obtain the Apostille Seal, please contact the Secretary of State Office or visit: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travel.state.gov\/law\/judicial\/judicial_2545.html\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: windowtext;\"&gt;http:\/\/travel.state.gov\/law\/judicial\/judicial_2545.html&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt; (US residents)\n \n The United States Department of State requires that all Weddings Certificates from ceremonies performed in the Caribbean, including Mexico, have the Apostille Seal. This procedure can be done by our Wedding Coordinators with an additional fee of $250 USD. By requesting this service you receive: an extra copy of your wedding certificate, the apostille seal, translation into English and FedEx delivery to your home address, usually between 30 to 45 days after the ceremony.\n \n If a bride or groom&#039;s former spouse is deceased then a copy of the Death Certificate is required.\n \n Health Certificate Mexican laws require a Health Certificate for all Legal Wedding Ceremonies. Blood tests are done to determine blood type, HIV and STD status. Tests must be taken at the resort and results are ready within 24 hours. Approximately cost is $250 USD per couple (unless stated as an inclusion in your wedding package).\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Witnesses:&lt;\/strong&gt; Legal Wedding Ceremonies require four witnesses.\n If the wedding couple provides their own witnesses the following is needed; if not the Hotel will provide at no extra cost.\n \n Valid passport or driver&#039;s license.&lt;\/span&gt;\n \n &lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Tourist Card.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Witnesses must arrive at the hotel three business days prior to the legal wedding ceremony date in order to complete the legal document process.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Witnesses must be at least 18 years of age at the time of the ceremony.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri;\"&gt;RELIGIOUS\/ CATHOLIC&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Catholic ceremonies are available alone or in conjunction with civil ceremonies and can only be held inside a Chapel or Church. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/karismahotels.com\/ImEngaged\/Weddings\/Choose\/CeremonyTypesandRequirements\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Requirements&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;An additional fee of $600 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following documents must be presented for both Bride and Groom:&lt;\/strong&gt; Birth Certificates, Baptism Certificates, Confirmation Certificates and a letter issued by the Local Priest, addressed to the Priest in Cancun, allowing them to marry in Mexico. These documents must be received by Lomas Travel three months prior to the Wedding Date.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri;\"&gt;SYMBOLIC CEREMONY&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;This ceremony is not recognized as legal in Mexico or your home country. Preferred by couples already married and wishing to have a wedding ceremony, those thinking of a legal ceremony at a later date or those wishing to renew vows with their loved one. It is typically performed by a Non-Denominational, but can also be performed, for an additional fee, by a Religious Officiant. Some ministers speak English and for those that do not, the service is translated into English by our professional Wedding Coordinators.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/karismahotels.com\/ImEngaged\/Weddings\/Choose\/CeremonyTypesandRequirements\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Requirements&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri;\"&gt;Advanced Hotel Stay:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt; Bride and Groom must arrive at their hotel one full business day prior to the ceremony; for Example if your ceremony is scheduled for Saturday, your arrival date must be no later than Thursday as Saturday and Sunday are not considered business days.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128);\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: calibri;\"&gt;Important information:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt;Wedding consultations:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif;\"&gt; Consultations are held at the resort from Monday to Saturday\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Schedule&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Weddings are performed seven days a week except on Mexican holidays (January 1st; February 5th; Easter weekend; May 1st and 5th; September 15th and 16th; November 1st, 2nd and 20th; December 12th, 24th, 25th and 31st).\n \n Wedding time must be requested based on daytime savings: April through September \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Every hour from 11 am to 6 pm October through March \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Every hour from 11 am to 5 pm. For Legal Ceremonies, please consider the Mexican Holidays when reserving your wedding date as they will not be included in the three-day requirement.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709023,"PostDate":1358789748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <h1> <span  style=\"font-size: 18px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(100, 100, 101)\">Azul Hotels certified wedding coordinators \u00a01- 866-527-4762 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/h1> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"182585\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/182585\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">There are three main types of Wedding Ceremonies that can be performed: Legal, Religious and Symbolic.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\"><strong><u>CIVIL\/LEGAL CEREMONY<\/u><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br \/> <span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">This ceremony type is available 7 days a week, at any hour you choose. If you want your marriage recognized as legal at home you must have civil ceremony, but you can combine this official portion of the ceremony with a religious ceremony if you choose. Although civil marriages performed in Mexico are legal in Mexico, you must legalize your marriage in your country of birth\/residence. Do this by registering your marriage certificate at your local City Hall when you return home.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><a href='http:\/\/karismahotels.com\/ImEngaged\/Weddings\/Choose\/CeremonyTypesandRequirements' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Requirements<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\"><strong>Valid Passport:<\/strong><\/span> <span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Passports are required to enter Mexico and are also mandatory for a legal wedding to be performed. Passports must be presented to the On-Site Wedding Coordinator at the time of the wedding consultation.<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Tourist Card:<\/strong> These are provided on the plane prior to arrival into Cancun International Airport. Names on tourist card and passport MUST be the same.<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Advanced Hotel Stay:<\/strong> Bride and Groom must arrive at their hotel three business days prior to the legal wedding ceremony date in order to complete the blood tests and process the necessary documents. Saturday, Sunday and Mexican holidays are not considered working days.<br \/> <br \/> A Civil Ceremony Form filled out (available through your Wedding Coordinator) indicating witnesses name, age, nationality, home address and occupation.<br \/> <br \/> Additional documentation<br \/> If the groom is divorced no additional documentation is needed.<br \/> <br \/> If the bride is divorced (at least a year must have passed before she can remarry) and her passport is under her maiden name no additional documentation is needed.<br \/> <br \/> If the bride is divorced and her passport is under her ex-husband's last name, then she must present her Birth Certificate and Divorce Certificate translated into Spanish by an Official Translator and should have an Apostille Seal. The Apostille Seal is necessary when issuing a document from one country to another for legal purposes. For information on how to obtain the Apostille Seal, please contact the Secretary of State Office or visit: <\/span><a href='http:\/\/travel.state.gov\/law\/judicial\/judicial_2545.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\"><span  style=\"color: windowtext\">http:\/\/travel.state.gov\/law\/judicial\/judicial_2545.html<\/span><\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\"> (US residents)<br \/> <br \/> The United States Department of State requires that all Weddings Certificates from ceremonies performed in the Caribbean, including Mexico, have the Apostille Seal. This procedure can be done by our Wedding Coordinators with an additional fee of $250 USD. By requesting this service you receive: an extra copy of your wedding certificate, the apostille seal, translation into English and FedEx delivery to your home address, usually between 30 to 45 days after the ceremony.<br \/> <br \/> If a bride or groom's former spouse is deceased then a copy of the Death Certificate is required.<br \/> <br \/> Health Certificate Mexican laws require a Health Certificate for all Legal Wedding Ceremonies. Blood tests are done to determine blood type, HIV and STD status. Tests must be taken at the resort and results are ready within 24 hours. Approximately cost is $250 USD per couple (unless stated as an inclusion in your wedding package).<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Witnesses:<\/strong> Legal Wedding Ceremonies require four witnesses.<br \/> If the wedding couple provides their own witnesses the following is needed; if not the Hotel will provide at no extra cost.<br \/> <br \/> Valid passport or driver's license.<\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Tourist Card.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Witnesses must arrive at the hotel three business days prior to the legal wedding ceremony date in order to complete the legal document process.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Witnesses must be at least 18 years of age at the time of the ceremony.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><strong><u><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">RELIGIOUS\/ CATHOLIC<\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Catholic ceremonies are available alone or in conjunction with civil ceremonies and can only be held inside a Chapel or Church. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><a href='http:\/\/karismahotels.com\/ImEngaged\/Weddings\/Choose\/CeremonyTypesandRequirements' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Requirements<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">An additional fee of $600 USD<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\"><strong>The following documents must be presented for both Bride and Groom:<\/strong> Birth Certificates, Baptism Certificates, Confirmation Certificates and a letter issued by the Local Priest, addressed to the Priest in Cancun, allowing them to marry in Mexico. These documents must be received by Lomas Travel three months prior to the Wedding Date.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><strong><u><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">SYMBOLIC CEREMONY<\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">This ceremony is not recognized as legal in Mexico or your home country. Preferred by couples already married and wishing to have a wedding ceremony, those thinking of a legal ceremony at a later date or those wishing to renew vows with their loved one. It is typically performed by a Non-Denominational, but can also be performed, for an additional fee, by a Religious Officiant. Some ministers speak English and for those that do not, the service is translated into English by our professional Wedding Coordinators.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><a href='http:\/\/karismahotels.com\/ImEngaged\/Weddings\/Choose\/CeremonyTypesandRequirements' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Requirements<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Advanced Hotel Stay:<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\"> Bride and Groom must arrive at their hotel one full business day prior to the ceremony; for Example if your ceremony is scheduled for Saturday, your arrival date must be no later than Thursday as Saturday and Sunday are not considered business days.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 18px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128)\"><u><span  style=\"font-family: calibri\">Important information:<\/span><\/u><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\">Wedding consultations:<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-family: times new roman,serif\"> Consultations are held at the resort from Monday to Saturday<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Schedule<\/strong><br \/> Weddings are performed seven days a week except on Mexican holidays (January 1st; February 5th; Easter weekend; May 1st and 5th; September 15th and 16th; November 1st, 2nd and 20th; December 12th, 24th, 25th and 31st).<br \/> <br \/> Wedding time must be requested based on daytime savings: April through September \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Every hour from 11 am to 6 pm October through March \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Every hour from 11 am to 5 pm. For Legal Ceremonies, please consider the Mexican Holidays when reserving your wedding date as they will not be included in the three-day requirement.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married my best friend on January 24, 2011 at Azul Sensatori! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ambassador for Azul Sensatori and Karisma resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Official Azul Sensatori thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensator<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recommended Travel agency: Wright Travel<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/'>http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/<\/a>","Email":"miriamkhan@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.150.115.214","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1274743063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"murmel","Id":228512,"Name":"murmel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420559615,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc1de6bb273ada2cecf8738b4a0e0120","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WEDDING PACKAGES OFFERED AT AZUL SENSATORI&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;Packages are subject to change, and may have additional restrictions.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;Your dream, custom wedding starts with the Always &amp;amp; Forever package:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/packages\/El-Dorado-Royale\/Always-and-Forever\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Always &amp;amp; Forever &lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/packages\/El-Dorado-Royale\/Always-and-Forever\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;($950 - symbolic, $1,450 - legal, may be complimentary - see requirements below)&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;\"&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;\"&gt;CEREMONY DECOR&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Romantic &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ceremony&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; location&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Table with white linen&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Uncovered white garden chairs&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color:transparent;\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sound system with speakers &amp;amp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;microphone&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; (can be connected to iPod for ceremony music)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;CEREMONY SERVICES:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Non-\u00addenominational minister*&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Translation of ceremony&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Aisle runner (wooden plank at Azul Sensatori)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Wedding certificate*&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Filing of all documents&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Witnesses&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px;\"&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;RECEPTION:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Dinner reservation for wedding group in our international restaurant (Spoon restaurant, max 40 guests. Fee per person above the 40 guest count)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Personalized menu card&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px;\"&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;SIGNATURE SERVICES:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Expert Signature Wedding Designer&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Wedding Guest concierge&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Personal on site wedding attendant day of the wedding 3 hours&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Grooms room with gourmet bites on day of the wedding&amp;nbsp;12 -\u00ad5 pm&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Personalized wedding website&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Honeymoon gift registry&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px;\"&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;GOURMET HONEYMOON PACAKAGE:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;Private four course candlelit dinner on the beach&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Chefs special gourmet honeymoon breakfast in bed&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Chilled bottle of champagne delivered to your room upon arrival&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Complimentary use of WIFI&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;15% discount on spa services&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Fresh tropical floral arrangement in room&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Romantically decorated suite with rose petals, aroma therapy and candles&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Beachfront sky massage two for one&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;One night return stay anniversary voucher&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;Regulations&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Always and Forever is complimentary in the North American market for wedding couples staying in a qualifying category for 7 nights or more and booking a minimum of 5 rooms for 3 nights (or 15 room nights minimum) and includes either a judge or non-denominational minister. Other restrictions apply, see grid on website. For non-qualifying guests, Always and Forever is available for purchase for $950USD and includes a non-denominational minister for symbolic ceremonies or $1,450USD and includes a judge for legal ceremonies.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;At Azul Sensatori the qualifing room category is Premium (as of October 2014)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;----&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;MEMORABLE MOMENTS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;$2,950 US&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;At last! An elegant wedding collection with style and quality that goes above and beyond your wildest expectations! Karisma Hotels and Resorts possess an attention to detail that is unparalleled, and the Memorable Moments Signature Wedding Collection is no exception. Each collection has its own distinct personality. Add your personal touch, and you will find your Gourmet Inclusive\u2122 Wedding Event as unique as both of you!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/MemorableMoments\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;Memorable Moments&lt;\/a&gt; includes 6 new collections&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Coastal Bliss&lt;\/u&gt; - A contemporary seaside celebration: &lt;span&gt;Harness the essence of the coast in a sleek and elegant way with this collection. The natural beauty of the shore will complement you as you pledge your love to one another.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;u&gt;Sophisticated Soiree&lt;\/u&gt; - A city chic affair: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Explore the refined style in every trendy aspect of this luxurious collection. Combine that with sexy destination wedding details and your event is sure to be unforgettable!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;u&gt;Vintage Elegance&lt;\/u&gt; - Upscale whimsey: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience the classic charm of this captivating setting. Toast to your everlasting love while surrounded by fanciful features in a storybook scene that will be remembered forever.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;u&gt;Colonial Charm&lt;\/u&gt; - Old world fiesta: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Find traditional Mexican appeal complemented by sleek, trendy details in this exceptionally desirable collection. With an event like this, you are sure to make romantic memories never to be forgotten.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Majestic Elegance&lt;\/u&gt; - An impressive occasion: &lt;span&gt;Discover the vibrant splendor of this rich collection that will sweep you and your guests off your feet. The beauty of this lush experience will be rivaled only by the glory of your love.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;u&gt;Pure Glamour&lt;\/u&gt; - Classic Hollywood: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Encounter a dreamy atmosphere with shimmering hints in this lavish collection. This engaging affair full of extravagant details will leave you and your guests breathless.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe, &#039;Segoe UI&#039;, &#039;DejaVu Sans&#039;, &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/hotels\/Azul-Sensatori\/package\/Mayan-Ceremony-Wedding&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;Mayan Ceremony Wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt; $1,700&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Shaman&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2 Crowns of flowers for the couple&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Fruits, Flowers, Seeds and Rose Petals for the offerings&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sacred sweet wine&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sand Ceremony (2 colors)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;CD music during ceremony&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Translation&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;In the center there will be an altar with flowers, maize and grains, water, copal and fire. Everything that the Four Elements represent.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;When the couple arrives in front of the altar, the Shaman will welcome them.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;During this union the Shaman will bless them with the four elements. They will be blessed by the smoke of the Copal, Mayan natural incense, for the Understanding of each other.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;The Shaman will ask them if they have rings and will ask the couple to express their love.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;If they are near the Sea or in some natural surroundings they will be able to make an offering of fruits and flowers.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;The ceremony last approximately 30 to 45 minutes.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/hotels\/Azul-Sensatori\/package\/Memorable-Moments-Ultimate&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;Memorable moments Ultimate Wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt; $7,985 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Please click on the link above to see all that is included!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709024,"PostDate":1358789765,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>WEDDING PACKAGES OFFERED AT AZUL SENSATORI<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">Packages are subject to change, and may have additional restrictions.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">Your dream, custom wedding starts with the Always & Forever package:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/packages\/El-Dorado-Royale\/Always-and-Forever' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\"><b>Always & Forever <\/b><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/packages\/El-Dorado-Royale\/Always-and-Forever' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\"><b>($950 - symbolic, $1,450 - legal, may be complimentary - see requirements below)<\/b><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px\">\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\">CEREMONY DECOR<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;background-color:transparent\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span>Romantic <\/span><span>ceremony<\/span><span> location<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;background-color:transparent\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span>Table with white linen<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;background-color:transparent\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span>Uncovered white garden chairs<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;background-color:transparent\"><span  style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span>Sound system with speakers & <\/span><span>microphone<\/span><span> (can be connected to iPod for ceremony music)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">CEREMONY SERVICES:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Non-\u00addenominational minister*<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Translation of ceremony<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Aisle runner (wooden plank at Azul Sensatori)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Wedding certificate*<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Filing of all documents<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Witnesses<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px\"><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">RECEPTION:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Dinner reservation for wedding group in our international restaurant (Spoon restaurant, max 40 guests. Fee per person above the 40 guest count)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Personalized menu card<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px\"><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">SIGNATURE SERVICES:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;\">Expert Signature Wedding Designer<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Wedding Guest concierge<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Personal on site wedding attendant day of the wedding 3 hours<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Grooms room with gourmet bites on day of the wedding\u00a012 -\u00ad5 pm<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Personalized wedding website<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Honeymoon gift registry<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px\"><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">GOURMET HONEYMOON PACAKAGE:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">Private four course candlelit dinner on the beach<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Chefs special gourmet honeymoon breakfast in bed<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Chilled bottle of champagne delivered to your room upon arrival<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Complimentary use of WIFI<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">15% discount on spa services<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Fresh tropical floral arrangement in room<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Romantically decorated suite with rose petals, aroma therapy and candles<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Beachfront sky massage two for one<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">One night return stay anniversary voucher<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">Regulations<\/span><\/span>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">Always and Forever is complimentary in the North American market for wedding couples staying in a qualifying category for 7 nights or more and booking a minimum of 5 rooms for 3 nights (or 15 room nights minimum) and includes either a judge or non-denominational minister. Other restrictions apply, see grid on website. For non-qualifying guests, Always and Forever is available for purchase for $950USD and includes a non-denominational minister for symbolic ceremonies or $1,450USD and includes a judge for legal ceremonies.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"margin:0px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:transparent;\">At Azul Sensatori the qualifing room category is Premium (as of October 2014)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">----<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">MEMORABLE MOMENTS<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">\u00a0$2,950 US<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">At last! An elegant wedding collection with style and quality that goes above and beyond your wildest expectations! Karisma Hotels and Resorts possess an attention to detail that is unparalleled, and the Memorable Moments Signature Wedding Collection is no exception. Each collection has its own distinct personality. Add your personal touch, and you will find your Gourmet Inclusive\u2122 Wedding Event as unique as both of you!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/MemorableMoments\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Memorable Moments<\/a> includes 6 new collections<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><u>Coastal Bliss<\/u> - A contemporary seaside celebration: <span>Harness the essence of the coast in a sleek and elegant way with this collection. The natural beauty of the shore will complement you as you pledge your love to one another.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span><u>Sophisticated Soiree<\/u> - A city chic affair: <\/span><span>Explore the refined style in every trendy aspect of this luxurious collection. Combine that with sexy destination wedding details and your event is sure to be unforgettable!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span><u>Vintage Elegance<\/u> - Upscale whimsey: <\/span><span>Experience the classic charm of this captivating setting. Toast to your everlasting love while surrounded by fanciful features in a storybook scene that will be remembered forever.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span><u>Colonial Charm<\/u> - Old world fiesta: <\/span><span>Find traditional Mexican appeal complemented by sleek, trendy details in this exceptionally desirable collection. With an event like this, you are sure to make romantic memories never to be forgotten.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><u>Majestic Elegance<\/u> - An impressive occasion: <span>Discover the vibrant splendor of this rich collection that will sweep you and your guests off your feet. The beauty of this lush experience will be rivaled only by the glory of your love.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span><u>Pure Glamour<\/u> - Classic Hollywood: <\/span><span>Encounter a dreamy atmosphere with shimmering hints in this lavish collection. This engaging affair full of extravagant details will leave you and your guests breathless.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:justify;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Segoe,'Segoe UI', 'DejaVu Sans', 'Trebuchet MS', Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/hotels\/Azul-Sensatori\/package\/Mayan-Ceremony-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">Mayan Ceremony Wedding<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\"> $1,700<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>Shaman<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>2 Crowns of flowers for the couple<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>Fruits, Flowers, Seeds and Rose Petals for the offerings<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>Sacred sweet wine<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>Sand Ceremony (2 colors)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>CD music during ceremony<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>Translation<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>In the center there will be an altar with flowers, maize and grains, water, copal and fire. Everything that the Four Elements represent.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>When the couple arrives in front of the altar, the Shaman will welcome them.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>During this union the Shaman will bless them with the four elements. They will be blessed by the smoke of the Copal, Mayan natural incense, for the Understanding of each other.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>The Shaman will ask them if they have rings and will ask the couple to express their love.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>If they are near the Sea or in some natural surroundings they will be able to make an offering of fruits and flowers.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>The ceremony last approximately 30 to 45 minutes.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\"><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/hotels\/Azul-Sensatori\/package\/Memorable-Moments-Ultimate' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\">Memorable moments Ultimate Wedding<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\"> $7,985 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Please click on the link above to see all that is included!<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married my best friend on January 24, 2011 at Azul Sensatori! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ambassador for Azul Sensatori and Karisma resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Official Azul Sensatori thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensator<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recommended Travel agency: Wright Travel<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/'>http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/<\/a>","Email":"miriamkhan@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.150.115.214","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassad