;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;Cocktail area with tables &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;Ceremony location overlooking the Caribbean &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;Lounge area White glove service &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;SKY welcome cocktail served to all guests upon arrival\n\nSKY deck cold towel service for each guest during ceremony\n\nSKY deck fans placed on each seat\n\nPersonalized printed ceremony program with SKY deck photo\n\nSKY webcam service featuring live internet broadcast of the ceremony for up to 20 users Souvenir silver photo frame for the bride and groom.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;**Location has a maximum capacity of 80 people and is only accessible by elevator and then one flight of stairs. (not wheelchair accessible)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101);\"&gt;Live broadcast available by visiting the following link: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/karismahotels.com\/sub-page\/azul-sensatori-sky-wedding-cam&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;http:\/\/www.karismahotels.com\/sub-page\/azul-sensatori-sky-wedding-cam&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709026,"PostDate":1358789787,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Additional wedding packages<\/strong><\/span> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\">(you must have already selected one of the wedding packages above, and then add on the SKY wedding)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><strong><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/hotels\/Azul-Sensatori\/package\/azul-sensatori-SKY-wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>SKY Wedding Package<\/a> $1,700 <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">SKY deck ceremony location that accommodates up to 80 people<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">Cocktail area with tables <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">Ceremony location overlooking the Caribbean <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">Lounge area White glove service <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">SKY welcome cocktail served to all guests upon arrival<br>\nSKY deck cold towel service for each guest during ceremony<br>\nSKY deck fans placed on each seat<br>\nPersonalized printed ceremony program with SKY deck photo<br>\nSKY webcam service featuring live internet broadcast of the ceremony for up to 20 users Souvenir silver photo frame for the bride and groom.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">**Location has a maximum capacity of 80 people and is only accessible by elevator and then one flight of stairs. (not wheelchair accessible)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(100,100,101)\">Live broadcast available by visiting the following link: <\/span><\/span><br><br><a href='http:\/\/karismahotels.com\/sub-page\/azul-sensatori-sky-wedding-cam' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong><span  style