e:14px;\"&gt;WEDDING CEREMONY LOCATIONS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;1) PIER GAZEBO&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73570]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73567]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2) YOGA PALAPA&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3) PREMIUM SIDE GAZEBO&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4) SKY TERRACE&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73560]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73559]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73558]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73557]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73556]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73555]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73554]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73553]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5) THEATRE AREA (in case of rain)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709027,"PostDate":1358789796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">WEDDING CEREMONY LOCATIONS<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">1) PIER GAZEBO<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1709027]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2014\/post-228512-0-95396500-1392305964.jpg\" title=\"pier1.jpg - Size: 65.82KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2014\/post-228512-0-95396500-1392305964.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"pier1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1709027]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2014\/post-228512-0-24229900-1392305967.jpg\" title=\"pier2.jpg - Size: 167.33KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2014\/post-228512-0-24229900-1392305967.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"pier2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1709027]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2014\/post-228512-0-38970200-1392305969.jpg\" title=\"pier3.jpg - Size: 177.34KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2014\/post-228512-0-38970200-1392305969.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"pier3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/73570-pier-gazebo\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_12377\/sml_gallery_228512_12377_2710237.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Pier gazebo'  width='200' height='150'  alt='Pier gazebo' id='sml_image_view_73570' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a hre