'galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Zocolo terrace'  width='200' height='150'  alt='Zocolo terrace' id='sml_image_view_73563' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married my best friend on January 24, 2011 at Azul Sensatori! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ambassador for Azul Sensatori and Karisma resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Official Azul Sensatori thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensator<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recommended Travel agency: Wright Travel<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/'>http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/<\/a>","Email":"miriamkhan@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.150.115.214","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1274743063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"murmel","Id":228512,"Name":"murmel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1425522307,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a762eeac66e09481ab9042a690b9fce3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DINNER OPTIONS AND COST &lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;(PLEASE BE SURE TO CONFIRM PRICES WITH YOUR WC)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;There are a number of options available. Most wedding packages include a dinner package at the Spoon restaurant for up to 40 people (additional charge for extra guests).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;Please click this link for updated &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/Weddings_Banquet_kit_2014.pdf&#039;&gt;2014 Banquet pricing&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;comic sans ms&#039;, cursive;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/karismahotels.uberflip.com\/i\/183324&#039;&gt;http:\/\/karismahotels.uberflip.com\/i\/183324&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;If you wish to have a reception at a different location you are required to host a private event. Examples of private events are:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Pick and Choose lunch. Each main course comes with a choice of one appetizer, salad or soup, and one dessert. Prices from $16-34pp. (includes international open bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Pick and Choose dinner. Each main course comes with a choice of one appetizer, salad or soup, and one dessert. Prices from $16-28pp. . (includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;BBQ deluxe. $26pp . (includes international open bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 30 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Gourmet brunch. $21 pp. . (includes international open bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 30 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Petit gourmet. $22pp . (includes international open bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 30 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Family style lunch or dinner. &lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Salads, side orders and desserts served on the centre of the table to share. All main courses are tray passed. $39pp&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;(includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Italian family style $34pp (includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Mexican family style $34pp (includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 30 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Set menu $14-34pp (includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Asian standing cocktail party $48pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Viva la Rome standing cocktail party $34pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Mexican standing cocktail party $16pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests) (please note the donkey is NOT allowed at Sensatori)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Deluxe standing cocktail party $38pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Sweet standing cocktail party $16pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;IMPORTANT INFORMATION&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Please note that private meals are 4 hours, cocktail parties are 2 hours. If additional hours are requested there is additional per person charge. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;*Prices are from 2011 banquet list&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;CHILDREN&#039;S MENU&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;There are two options:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;1) choose the same option as the adults for 50% less. (ie. $36 for adult = $18 for child under 12)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;2) choose from their children&#039;s menu:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;chicken fingers and fries&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;hamburger and fries&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Mac and cheese&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;cheese pizza. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;These are free of charge for kids under 12. They prefer to have all the kids eating the same thing.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709029,"PostDate":1358789814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>DINNER OPTIONS AND COST <span  style=\"font-size:12px\">(PLEASE BE SURE TO CONFIRM PRICES WITH YOUR WC)<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">There are a number of options available. Most wedding packages include a dinner package at the Spoon restaurant for up to 40 people (additional charge for extra guests).<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\">Please click this link for updated <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/Weddings_Banquet_kit_2014.pdf' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>2014 Banquet pricing<\/a>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><a href='http:\/\/karismahotels.uberflip.com\/i\/183324' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/karismahotels...ip.com\/i\/183324<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">If you wish to have a reception at a different location you are required to host a private event. Examples of private events are:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<ol><li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Pick and Choose lunch. Each main course comes with a choice of one appetizer, salad or soup, and one dessert. Prices from $16-34pp. (includes international open bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Pick and Choose dinner. Each main course comes with a choice of one appetizer, salad or soup, and one dessert. Prices from $16-28pp. . (includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">BBQ deluxe. $26pp . (includes international open bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 30 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Gourmet brunch. $21 pp. . (includes international open bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 30 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Petit gourmet. $22pp . (includes international open bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 30 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Family style lunch or dinner. <span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Salads, side orders and desserts served on the centre of the table to share. All main courses are tray passed. $39pp<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"> <\/span><\/span>(includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/p>\n\t<\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Italian family style $34pp (includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Mexican family style $34pp (includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 30 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Set menu $14-34pp (includes international bar for 4 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Asian standing cocktail party $48pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Viva la Rome standing cocktail party $34pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Mexican standing cocktail party $16pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests) (please note the donkey is NOT allowed at Sensatori)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Deluxe standing cocktail party $38pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Sweet standing cocktail party $16pp (includes international bar for 2 hours, requires minimum 16 guests)<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol><p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">IMPORTANT INFORMATION<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Please note that private meals are 4 hours, cocktail parties are 2 hours. If additional hours are requested there is additional per person charge. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">*Prices are from 2011 banquet list<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><u><strong><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">CHILDREN'S MENU<\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">There are two options:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">1) choose the same option as the adults for 50% less. (ie. $36 for adult = $18 for child under 12)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">2) choose from their children's menu:\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">chicken fingers and fries<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">hamburger and fries<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Mac and cheese\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">cheese pizza. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">These are free of charge for kids under 12. They prefer to have all the kids eating the same thing.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married my best friend on January 24, 2011 at Azul Sensatori! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ambassador for Azul Sensatori and Karisma resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Official Azul Sensatori thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensator<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recommended Travel agency: Wright Travel<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/'>http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/<\/a>","Email":"miriamkhan@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.150.115.214","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1274743063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"murmel","Id":228512,"Name":"murmel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420559884,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7df6639ccad10484322476b743c0da29","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;DJ OPTIONS, MUSIC AND COSTS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;DJ&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;DJ All Music is the approved DJ for the Azul Sensatori. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/DJ-All-Music&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/DJ-All-Music&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(102,153,168);\"&gt;DJ Combo 4 hrs.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"&gt;A special DJ music service for a combination of indoors\/outdoors events. It includes: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Audio, 1 laptop Toshiba \/ W7 virtual DJ or Tracktor, 1 microphone stand, Lights, 1 laser show, 1 fog machine, 1 bubble machine, 1 portable tent (weather permitting), 1 Benq projector, 1 portable screen &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Staff: International Bilingual DJ, Bilingual MC&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Amenities: Neon bracelets, Balloons&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $2,000 USD Time: 4 hours&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Additional hour: $250 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(102,153,168);\"&gt;DJ Outdoors 4 hrs.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"&gt;This is the perfect show for your outdoors celebrations. It includes: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Audio, 1 wireless microphone, 1 laptop Toshiba \/ W7 virtual DJ or Tracktor, Lights, 1 laser show, 1 fog machine, 1 bubble machine, 1 portable tent (weather permitting) &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Staff: International Bilingual DJ, Bilingual MC&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Amenities: Neon bracelets, Balloons&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $1,500 USD Time: 4 hours&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Additional hour: $250 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(102,153,168);\"&gt;DJ Indoors 4 hrs.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"&gt;DJ music for your private indoors events (ballrooms \/ event rooms). It includes: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Audio, 1 wireless microphone, 1 laptop Toshiba \/ W7 virtual DJ or Tracktor, Lights, 1 laser show, 1 fog machine, 1 bubble machine&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Staff: International Bilingual DJ, Bilingual MC&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Amenities: Neon bracelets, Balloons&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $1,500 USD Time: 4 hours&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Additional hour: $250 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;IMPORTANT INFORMATION&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;*Should you wish to use a different DJ the resort charges an $800 outside vendor fee and they must be approved by the resort. The other option is to pay for a minimum 3 night stay for your DJ, so that they are considered guests of the hotel (in this case the $800 fee is waived).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"&gt;Also I have recently heard they may not be allowing ANY outside DJ&#039;s anymore (vendor fee or not). I am still waiting to get confirmation if this is true. Please ask your WC for clarification!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;LIVE MUSIC OPTIONS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Caribbean Band&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Three 45-minute sets from six musicians and a bilingual singer playing Bachata, Cumbia, Merengue and Salsa.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $2750.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Caribbean Duo&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Duration: 2 sets of 45 minutes&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $1400.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Cellist&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Duration: 1 set of 45 minutes, ideal for cocktails.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $650.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Flamenco Guitar&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Duration: 1 set of 45 minutes&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $600.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Mariachi Band (6 musicians)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Duration: 1 set of 45 minutes, ideal for cocktails.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $900.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Reggae Steel Drums (2 percussionists)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Duration: 2 sets of 45 minutes, ideal for dinners or cocktails.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Price: $1500.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;*More live music options available. Visit website for full listing and prices. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/live_music.php?cpp=3&amp;amp;pagina=1&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/live_music.php?cpp=3&amp;amp;pagina=1&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;EQUIPMENT RENTAL &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Ipod dock rental. 4 hours. $150&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;Audio system rental (includes speakers and microphone). 4 hour rental. $250&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709031,"PostDate":1358789823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">DJ OPTIONS, MUSIC AND COSTS<\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><u><strong>\u00a0DJ<\/strong><\/u><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">DJ All Music is the approved DJ for the Azul Sensatori. <\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/DJ-All-Music' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/DJ-All-Music<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(102,153,168)\">DJ Combo 4 hrs.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">A special DJ music service for a combination of indoors\/outdoors events. It includes: <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Audio, 1 laptop Toshiba \/ W7 virtual DJ or Tracktor, 1 microphone stand, Lights, 1 laser show, 1 fog machine, 1 bubble machine, 1 portable tent (weather permitting), 1 Benq projector, 1 portable screen <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Staff: International Bilingual DJ, Bilingual MC<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Amenities: Neon bracelets, Balloons<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $2,000 USD Time: 4 hours<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Additional hour: $250 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(102,153,168)\">DJ Outdoors 4 hrs.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">This is the perfect show for your outdoors celebrations. It includes: <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Audio, 1 wireless microphone, 1 laptop Toshiba \/ W7 virtual DJ or Tracktor, Lights, 1 laser show, 1 fog machine, 1 bubble machine, 1 portable tent (weather permitting) <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Staff: International Bilingual DJ, Bilingual MC<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Amenities: Neon bracelets, Balloons<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $1,500 USD Time: 4 hours<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Additional hour: $250 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(102,153,168)\">DJ Indoors 4 hrs.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">DJ music for your private indoors events (ballrooms \/ event rooms). It includes: <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Audio, 1 wireless microphone, 1 laptop Toshiba \/ W7 virtual DJ or Tracktor, Lights, 1 laser show, 1 fog machine, 1 bubble machine<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Staff: International Bilingual DJ, Bilingual MC<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Amenities: Neon bracelets, Balloons<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $1,500 USD Time: 4 hours<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Additional hour: $250 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128)\"><strong><span  style=\"font-size:16px\">IMPORTANT INFORMATION<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">*Should you wish to use a different DJ the resort charges an $800 outside vendor fee and they must be approved by the resort. The other option is to pay for a minimum 3 night stay for your DJ, so that they are considered guests of the hotel (in this case the $800 fee is waived).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Also I have recently heard they may not be allowing ANY outside DJ's anymore (vendor fee or not). I am still waiting to get confirmation if this is true. Please ask your WC for clarification!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">LIVE MUSIC OPTIONS<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Caribbean Band<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Three 45-minute sets from six musicians and a bilingual singer playing Bachata, Cumbia, Merengue and Salsa.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $2750.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Caribbean Duo<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Duration: 2 sets of 45 minutes<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $1400.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Cellist<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Duration: 1 set of 45 minutes, ideal for cocktails.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $650.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Flamenco Guitar<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Duration: 1 set of 45 minutes<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $600.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Mariachi Band (6 musicians)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Duration: 1 set of 45 minutes, ideal for cocktails.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $900.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Reggae Steel Drums (2 percussionists)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Duration: 2 sets of 45 minutes, ideal for dinners or cocktails.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Price: $1500.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">*More live music options available. Visit website for full listing and prices. <\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/live_music.php?cpp=3&pagina=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">http:\/\/www.weddingsbylomastravel.com\/planning\/live_music.php?cpp=3&pagina=1<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">EQUIPMENT RENTAL <\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Ipod dock rental. 4 hours. $150<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Audio system rental (includes speakers and microphone). 4 hour rental. $250<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married my best friend on January 24, 2011 at Azul Sensatori! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' clas