:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Cake 2 Tier <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">20-30 People <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:right\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$ 340.00 USD <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Cake 2 Tier <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">30-40 People <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:right\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$ 440.00 USD <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Cake 3 Tier <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">30-40 People <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:right\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$ 530.00 USD <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Cake 3 Tier <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">40-50 People <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:right\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$ 620.00 USD <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Cake 4 Tier <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">50-60 People <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:right\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$ 730.00 USD <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Cake 4 Tier <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">60-70 People <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:right\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$ 870.00 USD <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(173,216,230)\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Available flavours:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li>Red Velvet<\/li>\n<li>Oreo<\/li>\n<li>Vanilla rum<\/li>\n<li>Coconut<\/li>\n<li>Amaretto<\/li>\n<li>Dulce de leche<\/li>\n<li>Champagne<\/li>\n<li>Hazelnut<\/li>\n<li>Vanilla<\/li>\n<li>Chocolate<\/li>\n<li>Strawberry<\/li>\n<li>Lemon<\/li>\n<li>Carrot<\/li>\n<li>Funfetti<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/183191\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span>\u00a0<span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Large Heart Cake\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/183194\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span>\u00a0 2 Tier cake<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/183195\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span>\u00a03 Tier cake\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/183196\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 4 Tier cake<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">(all of the photos above are samples, colors and styles can be changed)<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\">Cupcakes are also available at a cost of $7\/cupcake.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married my best friend on January 24, 2011 at Azul Sensatori! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ambassador for Azul Sensatori and Karisma resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Official Azul Sensatori thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensator<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recommended Travel agency: Wright Travel<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/'>http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/<\/a>","Email":"miriamkhan@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.150.115.214","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1274743063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"murmel","Id":228512,"Name":"murmel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1420560317,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdfdc562f39a62fa64950fc59bfcb800","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Details&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt; -&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;if you uncover some other random expenses or options, please PM me!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ul  class=\"bbc\"&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;The wedding gazebo (beach pier) requires 2 sheers measuring 12m x 1.5 m each&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Sky wedding gazebo dimensions are 3.3 m wide x 2.4m tall x 2.8 m deep&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;****PLEASE NOT THE SKY GAZEBO IS NOW A WHITE GAZEBO! I believe it is similar in size, but not exactly the same.\n\n\n- the aisle length on the SKY deck is 94 ft, to the front of the gazebo.\n\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/183197\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/183197\/width\/500\/height\/1000&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul  class=\"bbc\"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Zavas plaza gazebo (these are also the old gazebo measurements...hope to update soon)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184520\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184520\/width\/350\/height\/700&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ul  class=\"bbc\"&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Walkway for beach weddings is a wooden runner&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Welcome bag (OOTbags) distribution $4 to $7 per bag&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;ul  class=\"bbc\"&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Additional items:&lt;\/span&gt; (*private events include round table for 8-10 people with white tablecloth. Also offered is a small \u00e2\u20ac\u02dcsweetheart\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 table for the wedding couple, if requested. Seats are wooden white folding chairs-not covered for wedding, but do have a white cover for dinner)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Table size: Round 5 ft across (usually an 8 person set up)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184521\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184521\/width\/350\/height\/700&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul  class=\"bbc\"&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Chair bows $5 each (any color)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Chair bows and chair cover $8 each (bow any color)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Full length table cloth $60 each (any color)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Organza (sheer) table runners $8 each (any color)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Satin table runner $10 each (any color)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Patterned table runners $15 each (assorted prints\/colors)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Table overlay $30 each (any color)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Tiffany Bubble chair (clear resin) $15 each&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);\"&gt;Tiffany\/ Chiavari chair (available in silver, white, gold, dark brown) $12 each&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;ul  class=\"bbc\"&gt;&lt;li&gt;There is a vendor meal for dinner available at a cost of $9 (usually includes a sandwich, chips and pop). This is only available for approved vendors.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;u&gt;Day Pass - $80 per adult\/$40 per child&lt;\/u&gt;: Includes food and beverage at the open guest areas on property, but does not include food &amp;amp; beverage for private events. These guests must be included in the private event counts. This pass allows offsite guests to stay for up to an 8 hour period. The pass must be purchased separately and paid onsite.\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"&gt;*All adult offsite guests will be required to present a photo id upon arrival; no exceptions.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"&gt;**Day Pass charges can be waived if you host a 4 Hour Private Dinner Event.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"&gt;***Offsite guests must leave once any private events are completed.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1709035,"PostDate":1358789839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:8px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Details<\/span><\/span> -<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">if you uncover some other random expenses or options, please PM me!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<br><ul  class=\"bbc\"><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">The wedding gazebo (beach pier) requires 2 sheers measuring 12m x 1.5 m each<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Sky wedding gazebo dimensions are 3.3 m wide x 2.4m tall x 2.8 m deep<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p>****PLEASE NOT THE SKY GAZEBO IS NOW A WHITE GAZEBO! I believe it is similar in size, but not exactly the same.<br><br>\n- the aisle length on the SKY deck is 94 ft, to the front of the gazebo.<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1709035]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-228512-0-31681700-1420560136.jpg\" title=\"sky.jpg - Size: 58.01KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-228512-0-31681700-1420560136.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"sky.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/183197\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...500\/height\/1000<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<ul  class=\"bbc\"><li>Zavas plaza gazebo<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1709035]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-228512-0-70130500-1420560163.jpg\" title=\"zavas.jpg - Size: 76.33KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-228512-0-70130500-1420560163.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"zavas.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n (these are also the old gazebo measurements...hope to update soon)<\/li>\n<\/ul><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184520\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...\/350\/height\/700<\/a><\/p>\n<br><ul  class=\"bbc\"><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Walkway for beach weddings is a wooden runner<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Welcome bag (OOTbags) distribution $4 to $7 per bag<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><br><ul  class=\"bbc\"><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\"><span>Additional items:<\/span> (*private events include round table for 8-10 people with white tablecloth. Also offered is a small \u00e2\u20ac\u02dcsweetheart\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 table for the wedding couple, if requested. Seats are wooden white folding chairs-not covered for wedding, but do have a white cover for dinner)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Table size: Round 5 ft across (usually an 8 person set up)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><br><p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1709035]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-228512-0-03741200-1420560189.jpg\" title=\"chair.jpg - Size: 42.39KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-228512-0-03741200-1420560189.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"chair.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/184521\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...\/350\/height\/700<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul  class=\"bbc\"><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Chair bows $5 each (any color)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Chair bows and chair cover $8 each (bow any color)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Full length table cloth $60 each (any color)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Organza (sheer) table runners $8 each (any color)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Satin table runner $10 each (any color)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Patterned table runners $15 each (assorted prints\/colors)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Table overlay $30 each (any color)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Tiffany Bubble chair (clear resin) $15 each<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24)\">Tiffany\/ Chiavari chair (available in silver, white, gold, dark brown) $12 each<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><ul  class=\"bbc\"><li>There is a vendor meal for dinner available at a cost of $9 (usually includes a sandwich, chips and pop). This is only available for approved vendors.<\/li>\n<li><u>Day Pass - $80 per adult\/$40 per child<\/u>: Includes food and beverage at the open guest areas on property, but does not include food & beverage for private events. These guests must be included in the private event counts. This pass allows offsite guests to stay for up to an 8 hour period. The pass must be purchased separately and paid onsite.\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">*All adult offsite guests will be required to present a photo id upon arrival; no exceptions.<\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">**Day Pass charges can be waived if you host a 4 Hour Private Dinner Event.<\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">***Offsite guests must leave once any private events are completed.<\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married my best friend on January 24, 2011 at Azul Sensatori! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ambassador for Azul Sensatori and Karisma resorts<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Official Azul Sensatori thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensator<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72018-official-azul-sensatori-thread\/?hl=%20azul%20%20sensatori'>i<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Recommended Travel agency: Wright Travel<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/'>http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/<\/a>","Email":"miriamkhan@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.150.115.214","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1274743063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228512.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"murmel","Id":228512,"Name":"murmel","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"72018","Title":"OFFICIAL Azul Sensatori Thread","LastPostDate":1429849450},"Pages":{"TotalItems":184,"TotalPages":19,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":180},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
