{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.61.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97d6e5bca3915094eb6e607c611fa8be","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1849224\" timestamp=\"1399655865\"]\nOmg AMAZING!!! Can&#039;t wait to get a quote!!\n\nCongrats on everything hun! So happy for you!\n\n&amp;lt;3 and thanks so much for sharing!![\/quote]No problems, happy to help! i was just checking the date that you are to be married. Im in Jamaica on the 26th to do my Engagement shoot with him. I will post some pics of his work. \n\nWhoever you choose, I know you are going to enjoy. Have you been to Jamaica before?","Attachments":[],"Id":1849227,"PostDate":1399656264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 09 May 2014 - 09:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Omg AMAZING!!! Can't wait to get a quote!!<br><br>\nCongrats on everything hun! So happy for you!<br><br>\n<3 and thanks so much for sharing!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>No problems, happy to help! i was just checking the date that you are to be married. Im in Jamaica on the 26th to do my Engagement shoot with him. I will post some pics of his work.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Whoever you choose, I know you are going to enjoy. Have you been to Jamaica before?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0789a5c3e20429b5b78190b90cce952d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes I&#039;ve been! My future hubby and I loved it so much!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We always said destination wedding and we always said Mexico UNTIL we went to Jamaica! ;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Many of our guests have been to Mexico too and have not been to Jamaica so it was an easy decision for us! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re in Montego Bay from Thursday, November 13th to Sunday, November 23rd! Staying for 10 days! YAY!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s so exciting that you&#039;re doing an engagement shoot there!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I met in Cuba! And we just happened to live a city away LOL long story haha&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So we did our engagement shoot in Cuba last October &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So fun to do an engagement shoot down south!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you been before?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849237,"PostDate":1399657275,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes I've been! My future hubby and I loved it so much!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We always said destination wedding and we always said Mexico UNTIL we went to Jamaica! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Many of our guests have been to Mexico too and have not been to Jamaica so it was an easy decision for us! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're in Montego Bay from Thursday, November 13th to Sunday, November 23rd! Staying for 10 days! YAY!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's so exciting that you're doing an engagement shoot there!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance and I met in Cuba! And we just happened to live a city away LOL long story haha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So we did our engagement shoot in Cuba last October <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So fun to do an engagement shoot down south!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you been before?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.61.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c82ce50c0ae70bac3be5215c90814d3","RawContent":"Wow, I&#039;ve never been to Cuba or Mexico but I would love to go to both. I have been to Jamaica.  Loved it so much my husband to be who is a builder built me a 2 bed house in Montego Bay. \n\n\nYou should show us your beautiful engagement pics!\n\n\nYour leaving Jamaica just before I come. It&#039;s such a beautiful place. I&#039;m considering moving there!\n\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1849242,"PostDate":1399657668,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow, I've never been to Cuba or Mexico but I would love to go to both. I have been to Jamaica.  Loved it so much my husband to be who is a builder built me a 2 bed house in Montego Bay. <br><br>\nYou should show us your beautiful engagement pics!<br><br>\nYour leaving Jamaica just before I come. It's such a beautiful place. I'm considering moving there!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.138.57.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46c955cdb9ad21a4f61937065a7c4c66","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello! I am getting married at Sandals Whitehouse on May 16th, 2014. One week from today. EEK! So much to do still!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849269,"PostDate":1399660762,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello! I am getting married at Sandals Whitehouse on May 16th, 2014. One week from today. EEK! So much to do still!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessica.f.waggoner.mil@mail.mil","IpAddress":"192.138.57.36","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399560797,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"seka21","Id":277895,"Name":"seka21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.61.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfa4c26a0035d3869c81dd01a2e2c222","RawContent":"Nice to meet you Seka21.  You must be really excited.  What do you have to do?\n\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1849271,"PostDate":1399660845,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Nice to meet you Seka21.  You must be really excited.  What do you have to do?<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.32.157.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"694208c9675944425fcb0529c53f0ef1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1849137\" timestamp=\"1399606544\"]\nHey HappilyEverAfter!\n\nNo worries on the auto predictor! ;)\n\nI&#039;m booking elite media...I think I might book a DJ through them too!\n\nI&#039;m having a VERY hard time deciding on a photographer though!\n\nWho are you going with??\n\n&amp;lt;3[\/quote]Hi, \nI wish I had know about this site before my wedding!  It is so helpful! I was married in Jamaica last year and we used Carden&#039;s Photography &amp;amp; Film.  I actually came to the site today to leave a review for them because they asked and this is how I found this site.  \n\nThey are a husband and wife from the states, but are taking on a lot of weddings in jamaica and talked of moving there eventually.  They did our photo and video and I loved working with them.  They are the nicest people and have beautiful work and pricing is very reasonable for the quality.","Attachments":[],"Id":1850162,"PostDate":1400023429,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 08 May 2014 - 07:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey HappilyEverAfter!<br><br>\nNo worries on the auto predictor! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><br><br>\nI'm booking elite media...I think I might book a DJ through them too!<br><br>\nI'm having a VERY hard time deciding on a photographer though!<br><br>\nWho are you going with??<br><br>\n<3<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wish I had know about this site before my wedding! \u00a0It is so helpful! I was married in Jamaica last year and we used Carden's Photography & Film. \u00a0I actually came to the site today to leave a review for them because they asked and this is how I found this site. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They are a husband and wife from the states, but are taking on a lot of weddings in jamaica and talked of moving there eventually. \u00a0They did our photo and video and I loved working with them. \u00a0They are the nicest people and have beautiful work and pricing is very reasonable for the quality.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelchic81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.32.157.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400006435,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rachelchic81","Id":277950,"Name":"rachelchic81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d95083a0fc6634a98c81b7f6ee72351","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rachelchic81\" post=\"1850162\" timestamp=\"1400023429\"]\nHi, \nI wish I had know about this site before my wedding!  It is so helpful! I was married in Jamaica last year and we used Carden&#039;s Photography &amp;amp; Film.  I actually came to the site today to leave a review for them because they asked and this is how I found this site.  \n\nThey are a husband and wife from the states, but are taking on a lot of weddings in jamaica and talked of moving there eventually.  They did our photo and video and I loved working with them.  They are the nicest people and have beautiful work and pricing is very reasonable for the quality.[\/quote]\nCan you share your photos and\/or video???\n\nThanks!\n[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1849242\" timestamp=\"1399657668\"]\nWow, I&#039;ve never been to Cuba or Mexico but I would love to go to both. I have been to Jamaica. Loved it so much my husband to be who is a builder built me a 2 bed house in Montego Bay.\n\nYou should show us your beautiful engagement pics!\n\nYour leaving Jamaica just before I come. It&#039;s such a beautiful place. I&#039;m considering moving there!\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nThat&#039;s amazing! A home in Jamaica - I would love that! &amp;lt;3 Maybe one day...:D","Attachments":[],"Id":1850209,"PostDate":1400031780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelchic81, on 13 May 2014 - 03:23 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wish I had know about this site before my wedding! \u00a0It is so helpful! I was married in Jamaica last year and we used Carden's Photography & Film. \u00a0I actually came to the site today to leave a review for them because they asked and this is how I found this site. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They are a husband and wife from the states, but are taking on a lot of weddings in jamaica and talked of moving there eventually. \u00a0They did our photo and video and I loved working with them. \u00a0They are the nicest people and have beautiful work and pricing is very reasonable for the quality.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can you share your photos and\/or video???<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 09 May 2014 - 09:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow, I've never been to Cuba or Mexico but I would love to go to both. I have been to Jamaica. Loved it so much my husband to be who is a builder built me a 2 bed house in Montego Bay.<br><br>\nYou should show us your beautiful engagement pics!<br><br>\nYour leaving Jamaica just before I come. It's such a beautiful place. I'm considering moving there!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's amazing! A home in Jamaica - I would love that! <3 Maybe one day...<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.32.154.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f54720b8553db1edd35276a6c43e4fb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1850209\" timestamp=\"1400031780\"]\nCan you share your photos and\/or video???\n\nThanks!\n\n\nThat&#039;s amazing! A home in Jamaica - I would love that! &amp;lt;3 Maybe one day... :D[\/quote]Photos - [url=\"http:\/\/cardensweddingphotography.com\/blog\/2014\/01\/jamaica-wedding-photographer-tricia-pat-secrets-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/\"]http:\/\/cardensweddingphotography.com\/blog\/2014\/01\/jamaica-wedding-photographer-tricia-pat-secrets-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/[\/url]\n\n\nHere is the main video - [url=\"http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/03\/11\/montego-bay-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick\/\"]http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/03\/11\/montego-bay-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick\/[\/url]\n\nAnd our coming soon - [url=\"http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/02\/14\/jamaica-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/\"]http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/02\/14\/jamaica-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1850243,"PostDate":1400067913,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 13 May 2014 - 05:43 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Can you share your photos and\/or video???<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's amazing! A home in Jamaica - I would love that! <3 Maybe one day... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Photos -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/cardensweddingphotography.com\/blog\/2014\/01\/jamaica-wedding-photographer-tricia-pat-secrets-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/cardensweddin...id-montego-bay\/<\/a><\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is the main video -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/03\/11\/montego-bay-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/cardensfilms....ia-and-patrick\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And our coming soon -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/02\/14\/jamaica-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/cardensfilms....id-montego-bay\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelchic81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.32.157.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400006435,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rachelchic81","Id":277950,"Name":"rachelchic81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbc45147db513c8ea1db46ea78d98bbb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rachelchic81\" post=\"1850243\" timestamp=\"1400067913\"]\nPhotos - [url=\"http:\/\/cardensweddingphotography.com\/blog\/2014\/01\/jamaica-wedding-photographer-tricia-pat-secrets-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/\"]http:\/\/cardensweddingphotography.com\/blog\/2014\/01\/jamaica-wedding-photographer-tricia-pat-secrets-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/[\/url]\n\n\nHere is the main video - [url=\"http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/03\/11\/montego-bay-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick\/\"]http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/03\/11\/montego-bay-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick\/[\/url]\n\nAnd our coming soon - [url=\"http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/02\/14\/jamaica-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/\"]http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/02\/14\/jamaica-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/[\/url][\/quote]\nOMG!!!! You two look beautiful...the pics are amazing!!!\n[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1849066\" timestamp=\"1399587416\"]\nHi Francine, Hi Pamela. How&#039;s all the planning coming along?????\nI have not made a final decision on who i will use yet to do the Cinematography. At the moment i want to gather up all my prices to see where my budget stands. I really can&#039;t go over budget. But if all goes well. Reynaldo Martin will be the cinematographer i use to capture my day. Have you looked at his work? It&#039;s a lot like Elite Media Concepts but cheaper. He is my favourite so far.\n\nFrancine as for my dress I&#039;m on a serious weight loss programme lol. I have been looking at Jasminesbridalshop.com as they make replica designer dresses and other brides who have used them on this website give rave reviews about them and the prices are very reasonable. I think I will go with them. I really want to try a blush coloured wedding dress!\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\nSorry my predictor on my phone changed Pam to Pamela. Please forgive me!\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\nPam what are your thoughts on the Cinematography?\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nThank you HappilyEverAfter!!  I am also trying to lose weight as well so my friend and I are doing a weight lose competition to jump start our way to a healthier lifestyle.   Thanks for sharing the website.  I plan to start looking around for a dress in September or so.","Attachments":[],"Id":1850293,"PostDate":1400087276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelchic81, on 14 May 2014 - 03:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Photos -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/cardensweddingphotography.com\/blog\/2014\/01\/jamaica-wedding-photographer-tricia-pat-secrets-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/cardensweddin...id-montego-bay\/<\/a><\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is the main video -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/03\/11\/montego-bay-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/cardensfilms....ia-and-patrick\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And our coming soon -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/cardensfilms.wordpress.com\/2014\/02\/14\/jamaica-wedding-videographer-tricia-and-patrick-wild-orchid-montego-bay\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/cardensfilms....id-montego-bay\/<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>OMG!!!! You two look beautiful...the pics are amazing!!!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 08 May 2014 - 02:16 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Francine, Hi Pamela. How's all the planning coming along?????<br>\nI have not made a final decision on who i will use yet to do the Cinematography. At the moment i want to gather up all my prices to see where my budget stands. I really can't go over budget. But if all goes well. Reynaldo Martin will be the cinematographer i use to capture my day. Have you looked at his work? It's a lot like Elite Media Concepts but cheaper. He is my favourite so far.<br><br>\nFrancine as for my dress I'm on a serious weight loss programme lol. I have been looking at Jasminesbridalshop.com as they make replica designer dresses and other brides who have used them on this website give rave reviews about them and the prices are very reasonable. I think I will go with them. I really want to try a blush coloured wedding dress!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk<br>\nSorry my predictor on my phone changed Pam to Pamela. Please forgive me!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk<br>\nPam what are your thoughts on the Cinematography?<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you HappilyEverAfter!! \u00a0I am also trying to lose weight as well so my friend and I are doing a weight lose competition to jump start our way to a healthier lifestyle. \u00a0 Thanks for sharing the website. \u00a0I plan to start looking around for a dress in September or so.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385514427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1430050176","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.151.52.42","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82da4aebd18d7a63400b6a5f159d3511","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Francine Braham\" post=\"1850293\" timestamp=\"1400087276\"]\nOMG!!!! You two look beautiful...the pics are amazing!!!\n\n\nThank you HappilyEverAfter!!  I am also trying to lose weight as well so my friend and I are doing a weight lose competition to jump start our way to a healthier lifestyle.   Thanks for sharing the website.  I plan to start looking around for a dress in September or so.[\/quote]Hi Francine,\n\nIm really doing well with my weight loss. Trying so hard. I dont have a fitness buddy but I&#039;m really on this thing. Down 16 pounds.....loads left still but Im happy. I have my engagement shoot at the end of this year and I wanna look SHAMAZING!!!!!\n\nHow are you doing hun, hows the weight loss and wedding planning?","Attachments":[],"Id":1851750,"PostDate":1400780119,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Francine Braham, on 14 May 2014 - 09:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>OMG!!!! You two look beautiful...the pics are amazing!!!<\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you HappilyEverAfter!! \u00a0I am also trying to lose weight as well so my friend and I are doing a weight lose competition to jump start our way to a healthier lifestyle. \u00a0 Thanks for sharing the website. \u00a0I plan to start looking around for a dress in September or so.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Francine,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Im really doing well with my weight loss. Trying so hard. I dont have a fitness buddy but I'm really on this thing. Down 16 pounds.....loads left still but Im happy. I have my engagement shoot at the end of this year and I wanna look SHAMAZING!!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How are you doing hun, hows the weight loss and wedding planning?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":106,"TotalPages":11,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":100},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
