> Time: 1430055729 / Sun, 26 Apr 2015 13:42:09 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=76118&start=100&SessionId=46862390cfaf5a822152d5a00ed54c52
> User Jaycee31 (282805)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.75.254.199","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d6f8cfe54ae7cef9838420b2119872b0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"leannenl\" post=\"1867798\" timestamp=\"1408536291\"]\nHi Everyone!\n\nI am so excited that I found this forum!!! I am getting married at the Gran Bahia Principe in November 2015! I&#039;m just getting started with the planning, so any advice is greatly appreciated :)\n\nThanks\nLeanne[\/quote]\nHi Leanne! I am getting married at Grand Bahia in August 2015!! Have you seen the forum \"Any grand Bahia brides out there?\" Its about 550 pages but it contains so much helpful information. There are posts a few years back but there are some new brides on there now bringing back the posts.\n\nAs for favours my FI and I are making everyone t-shirts and travel mugs! We have a group of about 50 so far so now everyone can recognize each other and not have to drink out of the little resort cups! hehe\n\nCan&#039;t wait to hear more about everyone&#039;s 2015 weddings :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1889078,"PostDate":1426170190,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>leannenl, on 20 August 2014 - 04:04 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so excited that I found this forum!!! I am getting married at the Gran Bahia Principe in November 2015! I'm just getting started with the planning, so any advice is greatly appreciated <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<br>\nLeanne<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Leanne! I am getting married at Grand Bahia in August 2015!! Have you seen the forum \"Any grand Bahia brides out there?\" Its about 550 pages but it contains so much helpful information. There are posts a few years back but there are some new brides on there now bringing back the posts.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As for favours my FI and I are making everyone t-shirts and travel mugs! We have a group of about 50 so far so now everyone can recognize each other and not have to drink out of the little resort cups! hehe<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to hear more about everyone's 2015 weddings <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen_law12@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"142.75.254.199","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421094329,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jenmasters","Id":281701,"Name":"jenmasters","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddad3479d4302458544513443b4235a4","RawContent":"Hello ladies!! \n\n\nI have tons of questions since I am getting married May 6th, 2015!! We are getting married at the Riu Montego Bay in Jamaica and we are beyond excited \ud83d\ude1d! \n\n\nOur wedding color is an eggplant purple since my wedding dress is ivory with gold embroidery. What type of flowers would look the best? (I have posted pictures of the bridesmaids dresses and the groomsmen outfits as well in my gallery! Take a look \ud83d\ude1c) \n\nAre there any hidden costs any brides could possibly warn me about as well? \n\n\nWe are getting married at the plaza gazebo and have rented the steakhouse for a private dinner\/reception as well. I have around 40-50 guests coming so is it ideal to rent a microphone during the dinner for speeches? And how does the music work?! Do I need to prepare a CD of our first dance~ Lady in my life by Michael Jackson ~ as well as the from &amp;amp; mother dance and uncle niece dance( since I am adopted by a single mother)? And if anyone has a song for that dance with my uncle I&#039;d love to hear them!! \n\n\nHow are the hair stylists at the Riu? Where they able to do what other brides requested for their hairstyle or were there difficulties? If anyone has pictures please share!! \n\n\nThank you for the help ladies and gents!! \u263a\ufe0f\u263a\ufe0f\u263a\ufe0f","Attachments":[],"Id":1889346,"PostDate":1426469916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies!! <br><br>\nI have tons of questions since I am getting married May 6th, 2015!! We are getting married at the Riu Montego Bay in Jamaica and we are beyond excited \ud83d\ude1d! <br><br>\nOur wedding color is an eggplant purple since my wedding dress is ivory with gold embroidery. What type of flowers would look the best? (I have posted pictures of the bridesmaids dresses and the groomsmen outfits as well in my gallery! Take a look \ud83d\ude1c) <br>\nAre there any hidden costs any brides could possibly warn me about as well? <br><br>\nWe are getting married at the plaza gazebo and have rented the steakhouse for a private dinner\/reception as well. I have around 40-50 guests coming so is it ideal to rent a microphone during the dinner for speeches? And how does the music work?! Do I need to prepare a CD of our first dance~ Lady in my life by Michael Jackson ~ as well as the from & mother dance and uncle niece dance( since I am adopted by a single mother)? And if anyone has a song for that dance with my uncle I'd love to hear them!! <br><br>\nHow are the hair stylists at the Riu? Where they able to do what other brides requested for their hairstyle or were there difficulties? If anyone has pictures please share!! <br><br>\nThank you for the help ladies and gents!! \u263a\ufe0f\u263a\ufe0f\u263a\ufe0f\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426462378,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.75.254.199","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f25e42451a46bbf8bd9c83fe468c3d34","RawContent":"&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282430-izzydeee\/\" title=\"\"&gt;IzzyDeee&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;I am doing my second week in Jamaica for my honeymoon at the Riu in Montego!! You will have to share how it is! I love your pics, amazing finds. We are doing similar, more lavender\/lilac with grey and a couple pops of lime green. As for hidden costs, just ask and keep asking the resort. I like having everything in writing for backup. I am getting a \"free wedding\" at my resort but because I want a fully private reception I am paying $2,500 USD. That&#039;s for 4 hours of private resturaunt, the dinner, cake, service, DJ, Dancing, Mic etc etc. We have about 50 guests so I didnt want to do my reception in a semi private setting. I know at the Bahia, we are to make everything on CDs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889874,"PostDate":1426708396,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \n\t<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282430-izzydeee\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>IzzyDeee<\/a>\u00a0I am doing my second week in Jamaica for my honeymoon at the Riu in Montego!! You will have to share how it is! I love your pics, amazing finds. We are doing similar, more lavender\/lilac with grey and a couple pops of lime green. As for hidden costs, just ask and keep asking the resort. I like having everything in writing for backup. I am getting a \"free wedding\" at my resort but because I want a fully private reception I am paying $2,500 USD. That's for 4 hours of private resturaunt, the dinner, cake, service, DJ, Dancing, Mic etc etc. We have about 50 guests so I didnt want to do my reception in a semi private setting. I know at the Bahia, we are to make everything on CDs.\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen_law12@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"142.75.254.199","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421094329,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jenmasters","Id":281701,"Name":"jenmasters","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1426708857,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34bcc6f7498a28f8d5f81e257f0a6b4e","RawContent":"For sure I can let you know!! [emoji4] @[member=\"jenmasters\"] \n\nWe did the caprice package with the private dinner [emoji4]. We were actually forced to do the private reception since we have close to 50 guests as well! Our cake comes with our package but we may decide to go bigger since it&#039;s our desert after the dinner! I was thinking of just putting it on CDs just in case anyways, just to be extra safe LOL!  Feel free to check out my planning thread also to see what we kinda have going on [emoji38]\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889875,"PostDate":1426708834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                For sure I can let you know!! [emoji4] @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281701\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281701-jenmasters\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jenmasters<\/span><\/a> <br>\nWe did the caprice package with the private dinner [emoji4]. We were actually forced to do the private reception since we have close to 50 guests as well! Our cake comes with our package but we may decide to go bigger since it's our desert after the dinner! I was thinking of just putting it on CDs just in case anyways, just to be extra safe LOL!  Feel free to check out my planning thread also to see what we kinda have going on [emoji38]<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426462378,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d98841b3eacdf20b5aaf75ff96f2ba72","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;We have a great new promotion for BDW Brides! &amp;nbsp;Book your wedding with Wright Travel Agency and fly FREE! &amp;nbsp;See below for more information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Book 15 rooms or more at selected properties and receive free round trip coach air tickets.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(199,135,115);\"&gt;Book 3\/16\/2015-5\/31\/2015 for travel through 12\/31\/2016&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;For more information:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"mailto:info@wrighttravelagency.com\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(98,158,152);\"&gt;info@wrighttravelagency.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Or&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;fill out our contact form:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/bride-groom-fly-free?LP=FlyFree&amp;amp;keyword=BDWThread\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(98,158,152);\"&gt;Bride &amp;amp; Groom Fly Free Promotion&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Or Call:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;1-415-839-7511&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;calibri light&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14pt;\"&gt;Featured Resort Brands:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;All-Inclusive Collection - Hard Rock Hotels&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Azul Hotels&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Casa Velas&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Dreams Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;El Dorado Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Garza Blanca Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Generation Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Grand Velas Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Iberostar Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Le Blanc Spa Resort Cancun&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;NOW Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Palace Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Riu Palace&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Royalton Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Secrets Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Valentin Imperial Maya&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u00b7\t&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Zoetry Resorts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;\u2026and more (inquire to see if your resort qualifies).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Terms and Conditions:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Offer is valid on new Group Bookings with Wright Travel Agency, LLC and applies to the wedding couple ONLY. A minimum of 15 paid rooms with a minimum of 5 nights per room (or a total of 75 paid room nights) booked in the group block in order to qualify for the offer inclusions.&amp;nbsp; Any complimentary nights or bookings made outside the group block will not apply towards this promotion.&amp;nbsp; Airfare must be booked and paid to Wright Travel Agency, LLC or its supplier to receive a credit towards coach tickets.&amp;nbsp; Wedding couple to receive credit 2-3 weeks after travel (valid for the wedding couple only when traveling from any US gateway, for a maximum value of $1,000.00 total for both tickets).&amp;nbsp; Customer is responsible for any cancellation fees once airline tickets have been issued.&amp;nbsp; Offer is subject to availability at time of signing contract and receipt of deposit, and may be changed or discontinued without notice.&amp;nbsp; Blackout dates, minimum night stays, room category restrictions, seasonal surcharges, taxes, resort fees, and other restrictions may apply.&amp;nbsp; Wright Travel Agency, LLC CST# 2084813-40.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890020,"PostDate":1426779759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">We have a great new promotion for BDW Brides! \u00a0Book your wedding with Wright Travel Agency and fly FREE! \u00a0See below for more information.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Book 15 rooms or more at selected properties and receive free round trip coach air tickets.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(199,135,115)\">Book 3\/16\/2015-5\/31\/2015 for travel through 12\/31\/2016<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">For more information:<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><a href='mailto:info@wrighttravelagency.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(98,158,152)\">info@wrighttravelagency.com<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Or\u00a0<\/span>fill out our contact form:<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><a href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/bride-groom-fly-free?LP=FlyFree&keyword=BDWThread' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(98,158,152)\">Bride & Groom Fly Free Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Or Call:<strong>\u00a01-415-839-7511<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'calibri light', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:14pt\">Featured Resort Brands:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">All-Inclusive Collection - Hard Rock Hotels<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Azul Hotels<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Casa Velas<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Dreams Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">El Dorado Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Garza Blanca Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Generation Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Grand Velas Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Iberostar Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Le Blanc Spa Resort Cancun<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">NOW Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Palace Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Riu Palace<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Royalton Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Secrets Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Valentin Imperial Maya<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Zoetry Resorts<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.25in;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u2026and more (inquire to see if your resort qualifies).<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center\"><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Terms and Conditions:<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">\u00a0Offer is valid on new Group Bookings with Wright Travel Agency, LLC and applies to the wedding couple ONLY. A minimum of 15 paid rooms with a minimum of 5 nights per room (or a total of 75 paid room nights) booked in the group block in order to qualify for the offer inclusions.\u00a0 Any complimentary nights or bookings made outside the group block will not apply towards this promotion.\u00a0 Airfare must be booked and paid to Wright Travel Agency, LLC or its supplier to receive a credit towards coach tickets.\u00a0 Wedding couple to receive credit 2-3 weeks after travel (valid for the wedding couple only when traveling from any US gateway, for a maximum value of $1,000.00 total for both tickets).\u00a0 Customer is responsible for any cancellation fees once airline tickets have been issued.\u00a0 Offer is subject to availability at time of signing contract and receipt of deposit, and may be changed or discontinued without notice.\u00a0 Blackout dates, minimum night stays, room category restrictions, seasonal surcharges, taxes, resort fees, and other restrictions may apply.\u00a0 Wright Travel Agency, LLC CST# 2084813-40.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_206696_17612_826124.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.90.183.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21b745add9432e64597779bfe6f8837a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Samantha2015\" post=\"1884403\" timestamp=\"1422423469\"]\nhey Francine, a great way to avoid much of the stress would be to hire a wedding planner, like acw said, most know what they&#039;re doing lol... i got married in Jamaica recently and opted to do all the shopping around myself... in my opinion, YES!, you would definitely avoid much of the cost associated with resort packages by booking the vendors yourself. My wedding photographer was Courtney Chen, he was recommended to be by a friend and i&#039;m glad i went with him, his work speaks for itself, he has a face book page and you could Google him. If you&#039;re also shopping around for a Makeup Artist[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial] i could recommend Charlie Montag Makeup Artistry, i had a few trials with a few other MUA&#039;s before coming across her website. she was excellent, price point was fabulous and very professional. [\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]i had 9 bridesmaids, along with my mother and my mother in law and she was nothing short of amazing... [\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]check her out if you&#039;re still shopping around for vendors [\/font][\/color] :)[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial] [\/font][\/color][url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/CharlieMUA\"]https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/CharlieMUA[\/url] .........[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]My decorations were done by Nishy Weddings, i think they have a website so you could also try googling[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial] them as well... overall, my budget was $5,000 (USD) and it came well under that..[\/font][\/color][\/quote]\nThat is awesome Samantha!! How much guests did you have at your wedding? Did you do buffet or seated dinner? Thanks for the references.  Please share a few pics, if you don&#039;t mind.  I&#039;m glad your day was beautiful and well under budget.","Attachments":[],"Id":1891836,"PostDate":1428175222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Samantha2015, on 27 January 2015 - 09:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>hey Francine, a great way to avoid much of the stress would be to hire a wedding planner, like acw said, most know what they're doing lol... i got married in Jamaica recently and opted to do all the shopping around myself... in my opinion, YES!, you would definitely avoid much of the cost associated with resort packages by booking the vendors yourself. My wedding photographer was Courtney Chen, he was recommended to be by a friend and i'm glad i went with him, his work speaks for itself, he has a face book page and you could Google him. If you're also shopping around for a Makeup Artist<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0i could recommend Charlie Montag Makeup Artistry, i had a few trials with a few other MUA's before coming across her website. she was excellent, price point was fabulous and very professional.\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">i had 9 bridesmaids, along with my mother and my mother in law and she was nothing short of amazing...\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">check her out if you're still shopping around for vendors\u00a0<\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/CharlieMUA' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/CharlieMUA<\/a>\u00a0.........<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">My decorations were done by Nishy Weddings, i think they have a website so you could also try\u00a0googling<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0them as well... overall, my\u00a0budget was $5,000 (USD) and it came well under that..<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That is awesome Samantha!! How much guests did you have at your wedding? Did you do buffet or seated dinner? Thanks for the references. \u00a0Please share a few pics, if you don't mind. \u00a0I'm glad your day was beautiful and well under budget.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385514427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1430050176","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":106,"TotalPages":11,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":100},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
