{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.10.210.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54faebbb717793753f55ecc6fad4de42","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mysticjade\" post=\"1840931\" timestamp=\"1395955579\"]\nWe were totally going to go with Iberostar but at the last minute changed to Royalton White Sands, we just fell in love with how modern it looked! Our travel agent specializes in destination weddings and especially Indian destination weddings, and she said Iberostar is great for Indian weddings, but Royalton has this perfect little gazebo we thought would be perfect, and wedding coordinator there has done Indian weddings before too. Our TA also suggested Lady Hamilton\/Palladium for an Indian wedding.[\/quote]Royalton is exquisitely beautiful! the staff is courteous and the food is amazing! (esp. the sushi bar and the steakhouse) I would definately reccmmend having your wedding there, contact Epic Weddings Jamaica for Sikh\/Hindu wedding cinematography, you can email them at epicweddingsja@[member=\"gmail\"].com, they are awesome!","Attachments":[],"Id":1881887,"PostDate":1420491502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>mysticjade, on 27 March 2014 - 01:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We were totally going to go with Iberostar but at the last minute changed to Royalton White Sands, we just fell in love with how modern it looked! Our travel agent specializes in destination weddings and especially Indian destination weddings, and she said Iberostar is great for Indian weddings, but Royalton has this perfect little gazebo we thought would be perfect, and wedding coordinator there has done Indian weddings before too. Our TA also suggested Lady Hamilton\/Palladium for an Indian wedding.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Royalton is exquisitely beautiful! the staff is courteous and the food is amazing! (esp. the sushi bar and the steakhouse) I would definately reccmmend having your wedding there, contact Epic Weddings Jamaica for Sikh\/Hindu wedding cinematography, you can email them at epicweddingsja@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com, they are awesome!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffandjo16@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.10.210.137","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420487782,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TiffiBride16","Id":281611,"Name":"TiffiBride16","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.115.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b79d2965853152e9bbd44e0a9594ccfb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Francine Braham\" post=\"1828589\" timestamp=\"1390585291\"]\nHi, \n\nMy name is Francine and I am getting married in my home island, Jamaica in June 2015.  I live in NJ. I am so excited, but my fiance and I don&#039;t even know where to start.  We are going to Jamaica in March 2014 for vacation to try to visit a couple resorts and reserve a date for the wedding. \n\nI read a lot of these posts and viewed a lot of beautiful pictures. We want a small wedding of 50 - 60 ppl. I like Sunset Beach resort because it seems to be affordable, but I also like Rosehall Beach Resort because their grounds are beautiful and spacious.  It seems to be more private.\n\nDoes anyone mind sharing how much they spent for their wedding? What were your big money items? Is it best to go with the resort for everything for the ceremony and reception? Or is it cheaper to get vendors outside the resort for things like decorations, flowers, DJ, photographer? Recommendations? I appreciate any feedback.\n\nWhen I go and come back I&#039;ll be sure to update on the forum.\n\nThanks  :)[\/quote]\nhey Francine, a great way to avoid much of the stress would be to hire a wedding planner, like acw said, most know what they&#039;re doing lol... i got married in Jamaica recently and opted to do all the shopping around myself... in my opinion, YES!, you would definitely avoid much of the cost associated with resort packages by booking the vendors yourself. My wedding photographer was Courtney Chen, he was recommended to be by a friend and i&#039;m glad i went with him, his work speaks for itself, he has a face book page and you could Google him. If you&#039;re also shopping around for a Makeup Artist[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial] i could recommend Charlie Montag Makeup Artistry, i had a few trials with a few other MUA&#039;s before coming across her website. she was excellent, price point was fabulous and very professional. [\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]i had 9 bridesmaids, along with my mother and my mother in law and she was nothing short of amazing... [\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]check her out if you&#039;re still shopping around for vendors [\/font][\/color] :)[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial] [\/font][\/color][url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/CharlieMUA\"]https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/CharlieMUA[\/url] .........[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]My decorations were done by Nishy Weddings, i think they have a website so you could also try googling[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial] them as well... overall, my budget was $5,000 (USD) and it came well under that..[\/font][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1884403,"PostDate":1422423469,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Francine Braham, on 24 January 2014 - 09:41 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My name is Francine and I am getting married in my home island, Jamaica in June 2015. \u00a0I live in NJ. I am so excited, but my fiance and I don't even know where to start. \u00a0We are going to Jamaica in March 2014 for vacation to try to visit a couple resorts and reserve a date for the wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I read a lot of these posts and viewed a lot of beautiful pictures. We want a small wedding of 50 - 60 ppl. I like Sunset Beach resort because it seems to be affordable, but I also like Rosehall Beach Resort because their grounds are beautiful and spacious. \u00a0It seems to be more private.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone mind sharing how much they spent for their wedding? What were your big money items? Is it best to go with the resort for everything for the ceremony and reception? Or is it cheaper to get vendors outside the resort for things like decorations, flowers, DJ, photographer? Recommendations? I appreciate any feedback.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When I go and come back I'll be sure to update on the forum.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>hey Francine, a great way to avoid much of the stress would be to hire a wedding planner, like acw said, most know what they're doing lol... i got married in Jamaica recently and opted to do all the shopping around myself... in my opinion, YES!, you would definitely avoid much of the cost associated with resort packages by booking the vendors yourself. My wedding photographer was Courtney Chen, he was recommended to be by a friend and i'm glad i went with him, his work speaks for itself, he has a face book page and you could Google him. If you're also shopping around for a Makeup Artist<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0i could recommend Charlie Montag Makeup Artistry, i had a few trials with a few other MUA's before coming across her website. she was excellent, price point was fabulous and very professional.\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">i had 9 bridesmaids, along with my mother and my mother in law and she was nothing short of amazing...\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">check her out if you're still shopping around for vendors\u00a0<\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/CharlieMUA' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/CharlieMUA<\/a>\u00a0.........<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">My decorations were done by Nishy Weddings, i think they have a website so you could also try\u00a0googling<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0them as well... overall, my\u00a0budget was $5,000 (USD) and it came well under that..<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>We Did!\u00a0","Email":"charlettemontague@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.252.115.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422417848,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281910.jpg?_r=1422420999","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Samantha2015","Id":281910,"Name":"Samantha2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.188.106.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee49dfd173c9ea93d6f4be15f0aef52f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Samantha, please do tell how you kept your budget so well. I have been contacting so many outside vendors and I just haven&#039;t found any with decent prices but I will look up the ones you named. &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884474,"PostDate":1422476138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong>Samantha, please do tell how you kept your budget so well. I have been contacting so many outside vendors and I just haven't found any with decent prices but I will look up the ones you named. <\/strong><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cankem80@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.253.50.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407537957,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279372.png?_r=1419883596","PhotoWidth":135,"PhotoHeight":176,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cankem80","Id":279372,"Name":"cankem80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.190.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a8fcd817c77074d1e8f5d0d2cd4c622","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1844219\" timestamp=\"1397465521\"]\nHi Everyone and welcome,\n\nWe are also planning our wedding in Ocho Rios in 2015 but in December. We have 80 to 100 guests and the location will be the gorgeous Laughing Waters and the ceremony is possibly Prospect Chapel.  I also have no idea what favours to give my guests. I want either something they can use or something they can truly treasure, something handmade like a special Jam.......hellllpp[\/quote]Hi there,\nI was recently told about Laughing Waters and the pictures look amazing!! That&#039;s awesome that you&#039;re hosting your wedding there.\n\nThere is rarely any info online about renting out the venue. Did you hire a wedding planner to help you coordinate your reception at Laughing Waters? I&#039;d like to know how I can also arrange my wedding at Laughing Waters.\n\nAny info will help.\n\nThanks so much!\n\n-A","Attachments":[],"Id":1887629,"PostDate":1424983243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 14 April 2014 - 12:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Everyone and welcome,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are also planning our wedding in Ocho Rios in 2015 but in December. We have 80 to 100 guests and the location will be the gorgeous Laughing Waters and the ceremony is possibly Prospect Chapel. \u00a0I also have no idea what favours to give my guests. I want either something they can use or something they can truly treasure, something handmade like a special Jam.......hellllpp<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi there,<\/p>\n<p>I was recently told about Laughing Waters and the pictures look amazing!! That's awesome that you're hosting your wedding there.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There is rarely any info online about renting out the venue. Did you hire a wedding planner to help you coordinate your reception at Laughing Waters? I'd like to know how I can also arrange my wedding at Laughing Waters.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any info will help.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-A<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alicia.wm.yeh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.179.189","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420495609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Alicia328","Id":281612,"Name":"Alicia328","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"578ca34ee6922f0dddce7109d4d54933","RawContent":"Hello everyone,\n\n\nAny Hilton Rose Hall brides out there?","Attachments":[],"Id":1887858,"PostDate":1425211198,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello everyone,<br><br>\nAny Hilton Rose Hall brides out there? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421707270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.183.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1425319637,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c7c72463780190f08e6320bdde563d3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey brides! If you haven&#039;t booked your wedding photographer and makeup artist yet you can check out these awesome people Joel Finnigen Photography and Awaken AnewU Beauty Studio! They don&#039;t only do makeup but they do nails, waxing and facials also! Here are the link to their Facebook pages &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/JoelFinnigen?ref=br_tf&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/JoelFinnigen?ref=br_tf&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/AwakenANEWU&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888005,"PostDate":1425319613,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey brides! If you haven't booked your wedding photographer and makeup artist yet you can check out these awesome people Joel Finnigen Photography and Awaken AnewU Beauty Studio! They don't only do makeup but they do nails, waxing and facials also! Here are the link to their Facebook pages <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/JoelFinnigen?ref=br_tf' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...nigen?ref=br_tf<\/a>\u00a0<a>and\u00a0https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/AwakenANEWU<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sashi2hot@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.252.183.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425316509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrookM","Id":282293,"Name":"BrookM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.236.15.40","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44c16fa31462b33240cc524be73b8562","RawContent":"Hey ladies, has anyone booked a vendor who provides a photo booth for guests to take their own pics as a fun mementos?","Attachments":[],"Id":1888024,"PostDate":1425324209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies, has anyone booked a vendor who provides a photo booth for guests to take their own pics as a fun mementos? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"josie169@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.245.53.56","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416698174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mangojan","Id":281230,"Name":"mangojan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.230.59.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cc4dfaa0d8e806a7e001c40f211d913","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;no, but I have heard about freeze frame. You can try looking them up.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888156,"PostDate":1425400494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>no, but I have heard about freeze frame. You can try looking them up.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sxydivas@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.230.59.90","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420950711,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CarlyW","Id":281676,"Name":"CarlyW","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.228.159.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1425449025,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"403c2874c44b035f0976ba8a7a068748","RawContent":"My wedding is April 4th at RIU Montego Bay so a month away! Just really starting to get things in order... Can anyone recommend a hair stylist or makeup artist? What are you all doing for decorations? My colors are hot pink\/magenta, light pink\/blush, silver, grey and ivory. Suggestions for music? I think I may bring an iPod or CDs with a bunch of songs since we are renting out the disco club. Thanks for the advice in advance!","Attachments":[],"Id":1888266,"PostDate":1425448883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My wedding is April 4th at RIU Montego Bay so a month away! Just really starting to get things in order... Can anyone recommend a hair stylist or makeup artist? What are you all doing for decorations? My colors are hot pink\/magenta, light pink\/blush, silver, grey and ivory. Suggestions for music? I think I may bring an iPod or CDs with a bunch of songs since we are renting out the disco club. Thanks for the advice in advance!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"np_2003@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.74.175","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391222466,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276426.jpg?_r=1425447500","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NikkiMarie05","Id":276426,"Name":"NikkiMarie05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.230.59.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc71f0de79103b1bfc8a15335b3601da","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For hair and makeup NikkiMarieo5, you can try In Your Face Beauty Bar. here is their website &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039;